    "title": "One critically injured after North Memphis shooting: MPD - NewsBreak",
    "text": "MEMPHIS, Tenn. — Police are investigating a North Memphis shooting that left one person in critical condition on Wednesday. At 8:18 p.m., officers responded to a shooting victim at Regional One Hospital. The victim was reported in critical condition. Police say the shooting occurred in the 1400 block of Chelsea Avenue. This is an ongoing investigation. If you have any information that could help police, call CrimeStoppers at 901-528-CASH. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WREG.com.",
